class_name Vaults
extends RefCounted
## Hand-written set-piece rooms, stamped into generated dungeons the way Dungeon Crawl Stone Soup places its
## vaults. Written in the map format (see DungeonMapParser): "#" here is a statue or column inside the room.
## Every vault keeps a ring of plain floor along its edge, so a corridor's door always opens onto floor.
## Each branch has its own (see Branch.vaults): a lake with shallow shores in the Lair, a rubble cavern in the Orcish Mines, a
## catacomb in the Crypt, a lava lake in the Depths.
## Pure: the caller passes the random number generator.

const SIZE := Vector2i(22, 14)
const DESIGNS := {
